- ast_builder: provide the **complete framework and pattern** with the generic rule-index approach, including helper functions (`childrenOf`, operator detection, `buildBinaryChain`) and a couple of fully implemented cases; then a table listing which rule families remain and the one-line recipe for each. They fill in ~15 case groups.
- main.cpp changes: full (glue).
